    "ja": "第六天魔王　信長"
   },
   {
    "en": "Devil King of the Sixth Heaven: Nobunaga"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Oda Nobunaga, also known as the \"Devil King\", is on the verge of conquering Japan, unifying the country under the House of Oda, a feat that has never been done before! However, such a task cannot be done without jumping over some hurdles. With scheming underlings and constant military clashes, can the Devil King achieve his goal of unifying the country? Witness the last days of the infamous Nobunaga through the lense of his head page Mori Ranmaru, and see for yourself the full chain of events that went down in the \"Honno Temple Incident\"!",
   "ja": "群雄割拠の戦国時代の世、天下布武を目前に「本能寺」に散った織田信長の姿を、未だかつて無い角度から描写！本能寺の変の本当の黒幕とは!?"
  },
